,0.053,0.023,0.75,0.313,0.219,0.097,0.284,0.285,0.816,0.948,0.354,0.096,0.478,0.686,0.559,0.158,0.468,0.379,0.272,0.234,0.219,0.221,0.202,0.179,0.229,0.19,0.127,0.037],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"NARRATOR: City Infrastructure Investigator Cye Snopes rushes out of the police building, with his partner, Martine , quick on his heels. He doesn’t even know where the case needs him yet, but he’s already on his way.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":9.344,"end":20.768,"frac":0.944,"status":"ok","matched":34,"words":36},"large":{"start":9.344,"end":20.768,"frac":0.944,"status":"ok","matched":34,"words":36},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"[walking sfx]","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":2},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":2},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"MARTINE: Cye, slow down. You know the higher-ups. If you mess up it could come down on the whole department.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":23.872,"end":30.784,"frac":0.857,"status":"ok","matched":18,"words":21},"large":{"start":23.872,"end":30.784,"frac":0.905,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":21},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"CYE: Martine, you’ve got to have a better reason to fob a case off than some fussy bureaucrat's ego.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":31.104,"end":36.704,"frac":0.947,"status":"ok","matched":18,"words":19},"large":{"start":31.104,"end":36.704,"frac":0.947,"status":"ok","matched":18,"words":19},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"NARRATOR: Cye throws on his jacket and messenger bag full of investigator’s tools. There is a patch on the jacket’s left side of a single small rose, a fine complement to his golden-reflective investigator’s insignia on the right.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":37.44,"end":51.2,"frac":0.923,"status":"ok","matched":36,"words":39},"large":{"start":37.44,"end":51.2,"frac":0.949,"status":"ok","matched":37,"words":39},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"MARTINE: The facts…are messy. First responders contacted the On-Call Oracle and there was some kind of… interference. From what we can tell he might have been… well, unlicensed?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":51.808,"end":63.22,"frac":0.967,"status":"ok","matched":29,"words":30},"large":{"start":51.808,"end":63.02,"frac":0.967,"status":"ok","matched":29,"words":30},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"CYE: Sorry, the deceased was a seer ?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":63.968,"end":66.912,"frac":0.857,"status":"ok","matched":6,"words":7},"large":{"start":63.968,"end":66.912,"frac":0.857,"status":"ok","matched":6,"words":7},"differ":false},{"i":7,"text":"MARTINE: Could have been. This isn’t like exposing fae-prejudice at citizen services, Cye. You know how seriously the Minister treats prophecy-crime. We should send this to their department!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":67.296,"end":78.528,"frac":0.9,"status":"ok","matched":27,"words":30},"large":{"start":67.296,"end":78.52,"frac":0.9,"status":"ok","matched":27,"words":30},"differ":false},{"i":8,"text":"NARRATOR: Cye knows if he passes off the case, it’ll be buried within the week. There’s no unit quite so cagey as Prophecy-Crime. Whether the kid’s death was suicide or arcano-mechanical failure, Cye’s instincts tell him there’s something to unravel here.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":78.912,"end":94.368,"frac":0.93,"status":"ok","matched":40,"words":43},"large":{"start":78.912,"end":94.368,"frac":0.93,"status":"ok","matched":40,"words":43},"differ":false},{"i":9,"text":"CYE: But it came across our desks first…come onnn it’s our first interesting case in almost a year! You know my intuition’s never led us astray.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":94.848,"end":103.808,"frac":0.852,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":27},"large":{"start":94.848,"end":103.62,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":24,"words":27},"differ":false},{"i":10,"text":"NARRATOR: Cye eyes up the case file in Martine’s hands, itching to snatch it from her.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":104.16,"end":108.64,"frac":0.875,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":16},"large":{"start":104.16,"end":108.64,"frac":0.875,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":16},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/6ab6d81c3b87d_5-1a.jpg"}